{"seq":3,"slug":"fairness-exploration","title":"推荐系统公平性与探索-利用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommendation-algorithms/advanced/fairness-exploration","wordCount":1572,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"推荐系统公平性与探索-利用\">推荐系统公平性与探索-利用</h1><p>推荐系统不仅是一个技术系统，更是一个塑造信息分发格局的社会系统。当算法过度优化短期点击率时，可能制造信息茧房、加剧马太效应、损害创作者生态。公平性（Fairness）和探索-利用（Exploration-Exploitation）是确保推荐系统长期健康运转的两大核心议题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>公平性关注&quot;谁被推荐系统善待、谁被忽视&quot;；探索-利用关注&quot;在已知有效策略与发现新机会之间如何平衡&quot;。两者深度交织——充分的探索是实现公平的前提，公平约束指导探索的方向。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[推荐系统目标] --&gt; B[短期目标: 点击/转化]&#10;    A --&gt; C[长期目标: 留存/生态]&#10;    C --&gt; D[公平性]&#10;    C --&gt; E[探索-利用]&#10;    D --&gt; F[用户侧公平]&#10;    D --&gt; G[物品/创作者侧公平]&#10;    E --&gt; H[新物品冷启动]&#10;    E --&gt; I[用户兴趣发现]&#10;    E --&gt; J[长尾物品分发]\">graph TD\n    A[推荐系统目标] --&gt; B[短期目标: 点击/转化]\n    A --&gt; C[长期目标: 留存/生态]\n    C --&gt; D[公平性]\n    C --&gt; E[探索-利用]\n    D --&gt; F[用户侧公平]\n    D --&gt; G[物品/创作者侧公平]\n    E --&gt; H[新物品冷启动]\n    E --&gt; I[用户兴趣发现]\n    E --&gt; J[长尾物品分发]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>度量指标</th>\n<th>对立面</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用户侧公平</td>\n<td>不同用户群组获得同等质量的推荐</td>\n<td>组间 NDCG 差异</td>\n<td>头部用户独享优质推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物品侧公平</td>\n<td>同等质量的物品获得公平曝光机会</td>\n<td>基尼系数/曝光集中度</td>\n<td>马太效应/赢者通吃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>创作者公平</td>\n<td>创作者的内容获得与质量相称的分发</td>\n<td>收入分配基尼系数</td>\n<td>少数头部垄断流量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>群组公平</td>\n<td>推荐结果不对受保护属性有系统性偏见</td>\n<td>人口统计平价</td>\n<td>算法歧视</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"推荐系统中的偏差来源\">推荐系统中的偏差来源</h2><h3 id=\"数据偏差\">数据偏差</h3><p><strong>流行度偏差</strong>：用户更容易与热门物品交互（因为它们曝光更多），导致训练数据中热门物品被过度代表：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>交互</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>物品</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>交互</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>曝光</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>物品</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>曝光</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>物品</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{交互} | \\text{物品}) = P(\\text{交互} | \\text{曝光}, \\text{物品}) \\times P(\\text{曝光} | \\text{物品})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">交互</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">物品</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">交互</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">曝光</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">物品</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">曝光</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">物品</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>模型学到的不是&quot;用户真正喜欢什么&quot;，而是&quot;什么被曝光过&quot;——这形成了一个正反馈循环，热门越热、长尾越冷。</p>\n<p><strong>位置偏差</strong>：用户倾向于点击排名靠前的结果，不管内容质量如何。排在第 1 位的 CTR 通常是第 10 位的 5-10 倍。</p>\n<p><strong>选择偏差</strong>：用户只能对系统推荐的物品给出反馈，这使得训练数据并非真实偏好的无偏采样。</p>\n<h3 id=\"算法偏差\">算法偏差</h3><p>模型训练过程本身也会放大偏差：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>频率偏差</strong>：高频物品的 Embedding 在更多梯度更新下趋于更准确</li>\n<li><strong>同质化倾向</strong>：优化短期 CTR 的模型趋向于推荐已验证的安全选择</li>\n<li><strong>反馈循环</strong>：模型的推荐决策影响未来训练数据的分布，形成闭环放大</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"公平性干预方法\">公平性干预方法</h2><h3 id=\"去偏训练\">去偏训练</h3><p><strong>逆倾向加权（IPS, Inverse Propensity Scoring）</strong>：为每个样本赋予与其曝光概率成反比的权重：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">D</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{L} = \\frac{1}{n} \\sum_{(u,i) \\in \\mathcal{D}} \\frac{r_{ui}}{p(o_{ui}=1 | x_{ui})} \\cdot \\ell(\\hat{y}_{ui}, r_{ui})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8374em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>曝光概率低的样本（如长尾物品的交互）获得更高权重，纠正训练数据的选择偏差。</p>\n<p><strong>因果推理去偏</strong>：将推荐过程建模为因果图，显式区分用户真实偏好与各种混淆因素的影响，通过 do-calculus 估计干预效应。</p>\n<h3 id=\"排序约束\">排序约束</h3><p>在排序阶段施加公平性约束：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>曝光配额</strong>：为不同品类/创作者群组保证最低曝光份额</li>\n<li><strong>MMR（Maximal Marginal Relevance）</strong>：在相关性和多样性之间做显式权衡：</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MMR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MMR} = \\arg\\max_{i \\notin S} [\\lambda \\cdot \\text{sim}(i, q) - (1-\\lambda) \\cdot \\max_{j \\in S} \\text{sim}(i, j)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MMR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.716em;vertical-align:-0.966em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.309em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span></span><span class=\"mord vbox mtight\"><span class=\"thinbox mtight\"><span class=\"llap mtight\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0651em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.966em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6304em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><strong>公平性正则化</strong>：在损失函数中加入衡量组间差异的正则项</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"探索-利用方法\">探索-利用方法</h2><h3 id=\"经典-bandit-方法\">经典 Bandit 方法</h3><p>将推荐的每次曝光位视为一个 Bandit 问题中的 arm：</p>\n<p><strong>Epsilon-Greedy</strong>：以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 随机推荐（探索），以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 推荐当前最优（利用）。简单但探索效率低。</p>\n<p><strong>Thompson Sampling</strong>：维护每个物品 CTR 的后验分布，每次从分布中采样来决定是否推荐：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∼</mo><mtext>Beta</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>选择 </mtext><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_i \\sim \\text{Beta}(\\alpha_i, \\beta_i), \\quad \\text{选择 } \\arg\\max_i \\theta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4777em;vertical-align:-0.7277em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Beta</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">选择</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7277em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>天然平衡了&quot;不确定性高的探索&quot;与&quot;已知回报高的利用&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>UCB（Upper Confidence Bound）</strong>：选择置信区间上界最高的物品：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>score</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>μ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}_i = \\hat{\\mu}_i + c\\sqrt{\\frac{\\ln t}{N_i}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.8384em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6016em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-4.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5616em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:2.48em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"2.48em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 2592\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M424,2478\nc-1.3,-0.7,-38.5,-172,-111.5,-514c-73,-342,-109.8,-513.3,-110.5,-514\nc0,-2,-10.7,14.3,-32,49c-4.7,7.3,-9.8,15.7,-15.5,25c-5.7,9.3,-9.8,16,-12.5,20\ns-5,7,-5,7c-4,-3.3,-8.3,-7.7,-13,-13s-13,-13,-13,-13s76,-122,76,-122s77,-121,77,-121\ns209,968,209,968c0,-2,84.7,-361.7,254,-1079c169.3,-717.3,254.7,-1077.7,256,-1081\nl0 -0c4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000\nv40H1014.6\ns-87.3,378.7,-272.6,1166c-185.3,787.3,-279.3,1182.3,-282,1185\nc-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2z M1001 80\nh400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8384em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"深度探索\">深度探索</h3><p>现代推荐系统的探索从独立 Bandit 演进到更复杂的方法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>基于模型不确定性</strong>：用 MC Dropout 或 Ensemble 估计预测不确定性，对高不确定性物品增加探索</li>\n<li><strong>奖励塑形（Reward Shaping）</strong>：将探索信息增益纳入奖励函数</li>\n<li><strong>强化学习</strong>：将推荐建模为 MDP，优化长期累积奖励而非单次 CTR</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"新物品冷启动探索\">新物品冷启动探索</h3><p>新物品缺乏行为数据时，需要主动为其创造曝光机会（否则它永远不会有数据来训练模型）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>保量探索</strong>：为每个新物品保证最低曝光量（如前 1000 次曝光不参与排序竞争）</li>\n<li><strong>相似物品借用</strong>：利用内容特征找到相似的成熟物品，借用其 CTR 先验</li>\n<li><strong>渐进式探索</strong>：先小流量试探，根据早期信号动态调整后续曝光量</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"长期价值优化\">长期价值优化</h2><p>纯探索-利用框架仍聚焦于单次交互的最优决策。更进一步的方向是优化推荐系统的<strong>长期价值</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>用户生命周期价值（LTV）</strong>：不只看这次点击，而是这个用户未来 30 天的总价值</li>\n<li><strong>生态健康</strong>：确保创作者有足够激励持续产出高质量内容</li>\n<li><strong>多样性即长期目标</strong>：短期多样性可能降低 CTR，但长期能防止用户兴趣萎缩</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这一方向与强化学习深度结合，将推荐过程建模为长期序列决策问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>推荐系统的偏差来自数据（流行度/位置/选择偏差）和算法（频率偏差/反馈循环）</li>\n<li>去偏训练（IPS/因果推理）和排序约束是公平性干预的两大手段</li>\n<li>探索-利用从经典 Bandit（Epsilon-Greedy/TS/UCB）演进到深度探索和强化学习</li>\n<li>长期价值优化是推荐系统从短期指标驱动向可持续发展演进的方向</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"multi-task-learning\">多任务学习</a>——公平性约束作为多任务目标之一的建模方式</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../ab-testing-statistics/advanced-testing/interference-network-effects\">A/B 测试中的干扰效应</a>——探索策略的在线实验评估中网络效应的影响</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"推荐系统公平性与探索-利用","id":"推荐系统公平性与探索-利用"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"推荐系统中的偏差来源","id":"推荐系统中的偏差来源"},{"level":3,"text":"数据偏差","id":"数据偏差"},{"level":3,"text":"算法偏差","id":"算法偏差"},{"level":2,"text":"公平性干预方法","id":"公平性干预方法"},{"level":3,"text":"去偏训练","id":"去偏训练"},{"level":3,"text":"排序约束","id":"排序约束"},{"level":2,"text":"探索-利用方法","id":"探索-利用方法"},{"level":3,"text":"经典 Bandit 方法","id":"经典-bandit-方法"},{"level":3,"text":"深度探索","id":"深度探索"},{"level":3,"text":"新物品冷启动探索","id":"新物品冷启动探索"},{"level":2,"text":"长期价值优化","id":"长期价值优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"LLM 驱动的推荐系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommendation-algorithms/advanced/llm-based-recommendation"},"next":null}